    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="30.7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 30.7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gyf mon ðone laford teo, þæt he be his ræde ut léope ⁊ ær unriht worhte, nime him fif getreowe men tó ⁊ beo him sylf sixta ⁊ ladige hine ðæs.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if the lord is accused of advising the man who had done wrong to escape, he shall choose five trustworthy men, and shall himself make a sixth, and shall clear himself of the accusation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gif man þone hlaford teo, þæt he be his ræde út hleope ⁊ ær unriht worhte, nime him V getrywe to ⁊ beo him sylf syxta ⁊ ladige hine þæs.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
